{"page":475,"verses":[{"verse_key":"40:67","surah":40,"ayah":67,"ar_uthmani":"هُوَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَكُم مِّن تُرَابٍ ثُمَّ مِن نُّطْفَةٍ ثُمَّ مِنْ عَلَقَةٍ ثُمَّ يُخْرِجُكُمْ طِفْلًا ثُمَّ لِتَبْلُغُوٓا۟ أَشُدَّكُمْ ثُمَّ لِتَكُونُوا۟ شُيُوخًا ۚ وَمِنكُم مَّن يُتَوَفَّىٰ مِن قَبْلُ ۖ وَلِتَبْلُغُوٓا۟ أَجَلًا مُّسَمًّى وَلَعَلَّكُمْ تَعْقِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is He who created you from dust, then from a drop of fluid, then from a tiny, clinging form, then He brought you forth as infants, then He allowed you to reach maturity, then He let you grow old- though some of you die sooner- and reach your appointed term so that you may reflect.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"40:67"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"40:67"},{"pos":3,"ar":"خَلَقَكُم","en_gloss":"created you","transliteration":"khalaqakum","verse_key":"40:67"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"40:67"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تُرَابٍۢ","en_gloss":"dust","transliteration":"turābin","verse_key":"40:67"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"40:67"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"40:67"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نُّطْفَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"a semen-drop","transliteration":"nuṭ'fatin","verse_key":"40:67"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"40:67"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"40:67"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَقَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"a clinging substance","transliteration":"ʿalaqatin","verse_key":"40:67"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"40:67"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يُخْرِجُكُمْ","en_gloss":"He brings you out","transliteration":"yukh'rijukum","verse_key":"40:67"},{"pos":14,"ar":"طِفْلًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) a child","transliteration":"ṭif'lan","verse_key":"40:67"},{